{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[00:10.92]Murda on the beat so it's not nice\n[00:12.48]Her love isn't free\n[00:14.18]Had to pay a fee\n[00:15.86]We don't get along, let's agree to disagree\n[00:19.14]Love ain't meant for me\n[00:20.86]I'm not meant for love\n[00:22.58]Only meant for drugs\n[00:24.14]Kissing on the lean\n[00:25.96]I get so damn high let it sweep me off my feet, bitch\n[00:29.24]Every time I'm high, I be as happy as can be, bitch\n[00:31.92]But on the inside I'm sad, I'ma let it bleed\n[00:35.80]Shouldn't have let her leave, shouldn't have let her leave\n[00:38.88]I remember when my first love hurt me\n[00:42.06]Woke up on the hospital gurney\n[00:44.92]Cupid as the doctor\n[00:46.64]Codeine in my IV, mix it with the Hi-C\n[00:49.58]Higher than a high-five, everyone below me\n[00:53.46]I was \"Mr. Nice Guy\" I guess that's the old me\n[00:56.64]Made me bawl my eyes out, I deserve a trophy\n[01:00.00]Why you blocking my love? What are you, a goalie?\n[01:03.26]Startin' to feel the fame, don't know how to maintain it\n[01:06.68]You could be my heart even though that love's dangerous\n[01:09.98]Loner by choice I don't talk to strangers\n[01:13.32]Hold my hand I'ma walk with danger\n[01:16.28]If she cheated, put a knife to her throat, I'll slay her\n[01:19.56]Her love isn't free\n[01:20.84]Had to pay a fee\n[01:22.54]We don't get along, let's agree to disagree\n[01:25.82]Love ain't meant for me\n[01:27.50]I'm not meant for love\n[01:29.24]Only meant for drugs\n[01:30.80]Kissing on the lean\n[01:32.62]I get so damn high let it sweep me off my feet, bitch\n[01:35.90]Every time I'm high, I be as happy as can be, bitch\n[01:38.58]But on the inside I'm sad, I'ma let it bleed\n[01:42.46]Shouldn't have let her leave, shouldn't have let her leave\n[01:45.80]Baby I won't kill you that was just exaggeration\n[01:49.00]Or maybe it was real I'm super high and super angry\n[01:52.26]The way you left those scratches on my back you got me anxious\n[01:55.80]Cupid got an automatic and it keep on aimin'\n[01:58.98]I really got my eyes on you, no blinkin'\n[02:02.72]And I got my mind on you, no thinkin'\n[02:05.86]Wasting all my time on you, I'm tweakin'\n[02:09.24]Even though I'm in hell, my heart is freezin'\n[02:12.50]Her love isn't free\n[02:14.18]Had to pay a fee\n[02:15.88]We don't get along, let's agree to disagree\n[02:19.14]Love ain't meant for me\n[02:20.60]I'm not meant for love\n[02:22.56]Only meant for drugs\n[02:24.14]Kissing on the lean\n[02:25.88]I get so damn high let it sweep me off my feet, bitch\n[02:29.22]Every time I'm high, I be as happy as can be, bitch\n[02:31.92]But on the inside I'm sad, I'ma let it bleed\n[02:35.80]Shouldn't have let her leave, shouldn't have let her leave","words":[[10.92,11.22,"Murda"],[11.4,11.44,"on"],[11.52,11.58,"the"],[11.74,11.92,"beat"],[11.96,11.98,"so"],[12.02,12.08,"it's"],[12.16,12.24,"not"],[12.28,12.4,"nice"],[12.48,12.62,"Her"],[12.68,12.9,"love"],[12.96,13.2,"isn't"],[13.28,13.5,"free"],[14.18,14.32,"Had"],[14.38,14.46,"to"],[14.56,14.76,"pay"],[14.82,14.82,"a"],[14.96,15.22,"fee"],[15.86,15.96,"We"],[16.04,16.2,"don't"],[16.26,16.4,"get"],[16.52,16.9,"along,"],[17.06,17.26,"let's"],[17.34,17.66,"agree"],[17.72,17.8,"to"],[17.9,18.52,"disagree"],[19.14,19.36,"Love"],[19.42,19.52,"ain't"],[19.56,19.68,"meant"],[19.76,19.88,"for"],[19.96,20.04,"me"],[20.86,20.94,"I'm"],[21.02,21.16,"not"],[21.22,21.34,"meant"],[21.42,21.52,"for"],[21.66,22.0,"love"],[22.58,22.76,"Only"],[22.9,23.02,"meant"],[23.08,23.2,"for"],[23.28,23.7,"drugs"],[24.14,24.62,"Kissing"],[24.66,24.72,"on"],[24.78,24.84,"the"],[24.98,25.88,"lean"],[25.96,25.96,"I"],[26.0,26.12,"get"],[26.2,26.28,"so"],[26.38,26.48,"damn"],[26.64,26.82,"high"],[27.04,27.28,"let"],[27.34,27.38,"it"],[27.42,27.56,"sweep"],[27.68,27.74,"me"],[27.92,28.0,"off"],[28.04,28.06,"my"],[28.28,28.58,"feet,"],[28.66,28.9,"bitch"],[29.24,29.44,"Every"],[29.54,29.76,"time"],[29.8,29.92,"I'm"],[29.98,30.3,"high,"],[30.34,30.34,"I"],[30.4,3